text.en:
Section 35 of the principal Act is amended -

(a) in subsection (1) - (iJ in paragraph (e), by deleting the semicolon and by substituting a therefor;

(ii) by deleting "of $3,000" from the last line and by substituting "not exceeding $20,000 and, in the case of a second or subsequent conviction, to a fine not $50,000, imprisonment for a term not exceeding 3 years or both" therefor;

(b) in subsection (2), by deleting the first 2 lines and by substituting "(2) Any inside service so altered and any meter so interfered with, injured or altered shall be replaced or repaired" therefor.
